{"root":"gurau","ipa":"/ɡu.rau/","core":"指开玩笑、戏谑或逗乐的行为，通常带有轻松、非正式的社交色彩。","pos":["动词","名词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/ɡu.rau/","zh":"开玩笑，戏谑","phrases":[{"t":"gurau senda","zh":"打情骂俏，嬉戏"},{"t":"suka bergurau","zh":"喜欢开玩笑"},{"t":"jangan bergurau","zh":"别开玩笑"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia hanya bergurau dengan teman-temannya.","zh":"他只是在和朋友们开玩笑。"},{"t":"Jangan terlalu serius, ini cuma gurauan.","zh":"别太认真，这只是个玩笑。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"gurau","ipa":"/ɡu.rau/","zh":"玩笑，戏谑（名词）","phrase":{"t":"gurauan kasar","zh":"粗俗的玩笑"},"example":{"t":"Gurauannya membuat semua orang tertawa.","zh":"他的玩笑让大家都笑了。"}},{"w":"bergurau","ipa":"/bər.ɡu.rau/","zh":"开玩笑（动词）","phrase":{"t":"bergurau senda","zh":"嬉戏打闹"},"example":{"t":"Mereka sedang bergurau di taman.","zh":"他们正在公园里开玩笑。"}},{"w":"gurauan","ipa":"/ɡu.rau.an/","zh":"玩笑话，戏言","phrase":{"t":"hanya gurauan","zh":"只是玩笑话"},"example":{"t":"Itu hanyalah gurauan belaka.","zh":"那只不过是句玩笑话而已。"}},{"w":"mengguraukan","ipa":"/məŋ.ɡu.rau.kan/","zh":"拿……开玩笑，戏弄","phrase":{"t":"mengguraukan orang lain","zh":"戏弄他人"},"example":{"t":"Tidak baik mengguraukan kekurangan orang lain.","zh":"拿别人的缺点开玩笑是不好的。"}}],"derSlugs":["gurau","bergurau","gurauan","mengguraukan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-28T08:37:59.845Z","src":"base"}